  "modal.title": "Isaziso",
  "modal.text": "Bafeti abahloniphekileko! Iskin ngasinye esigalari le siyiphumo yama-awara amanengi womsebenzi. Ama-skin enziwe ngumdali wewebhusayithi avikelwe lilungelo lobunikazi: ukuwabukela kuvunyelwe, kodwana ukuwadawuniloda, ukuwakopa nokuwasebenzisa ngokwezentengiselwano kudinga isivumelwano sangaphambili. Ezinye izinto (amajazi, ama-texture wamabhulokhi neentjalo, njll.) ngezabadali bazo ababalwe emitlolweni echazako, begodu zisetjenziswa ngokuya ngemibandela yamalayisensi wabo. Siyathokoza ngokuzwisisa nangokuthembeka kwenu! Khumbulani bona le yisevisi ye-Minecraft engekho emthethweni. Ayikavunyelwa yi-Mojang namkha i-Microsoft begodu ayihlangani nazo. Abanikazi bewebhusayithi ngibo abanesibopho sayo, ingasi i-Mojang namkha i-Microsoft.",
